| `check_O` module headers | Refuses a code-root module without the `title:` and `summary:` header lines the corpus reads, and a code-root shell file without them in its opening comment block. | `make check` | [`shell.excluded_paths`](settings.md#configprojectjson), [`shell.script_suffixes`](settings.md#configprojectjson), [`shell.shebang_shells`](settings.md#configprojectjson), [`shell.test_suffixes`](settings.md#configprojectjson) | Judges the lines exist, not that the summary is true. The corpus indexes Python only, so a shell header is for the reader. | [python-style.md](../guides/python-style.md) | always |
